Qwen3-1.7B on a 24 GB M4 Pro (jitengine-qwen3-1.7b-m4pro)

This engine contains material from other Apache-2.0 works:

* mlx-lm (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-lm), Copyright 2023-2026 Apple Inc.
  - src/jitengine_qwen3_1_7b_m4pro/engine/_step_edits.py and patches.py hold text of mlx-lm's
    GenerationBatch._step and ResponseGenerator._generate (commit c39139d), which the engine edits
    in memory at start-up.
  - benchmarks/benchmark.py is mlx-lm's server benchmark, unchanged.
  The installed mlx-lm is a runtime dependency and is never modified.

* The Anthropic Messages and OpenAI Responses translators in src/.../server/anthropic_api.py and
  responses_api.py, and their tests, are from engines/qwen3.6-35b-a3b-m4pro in this repository.
